    "title": "Next Greater Element I",
    "category": "Stack",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "problemStatement": "You are given two arrays nums1 and nums2 where all elements are unique and nums1 is a subset of nums2. For each element in nums1, find the first greater element to its right in nums2. If no such element exists, return -1 for that element.",
    "input": "Integer n Array nums1 Integer m Array nums2",
    "output": "An array containing the next greater element for every element in nums1.",
    "constraints": "1 <= n <= m <= 1000 All elements are unique."
